Implement:

* local username/password
* strong password hashing
* secure server-side/session-cookie based authentication
* CSRF protection where applicable
* secure cookie settings

Keep authentication behind a clean abstraction so OIDC/OAuth could be added later.

Do not use HTTP Basic Auth as the primary application login.

Provide a documented command/workflow for creating the initial user.

