# 38. Exports

Support CSV and JSON export.

Small exports can be synchronous if reasonable.

Large exports must run as asynchronous jobs rather than returning massive blocking HTTP responses.

Provide status and downloadable result handling.

# 39. Feed deletion behavior

Removing a feed must not automatically delete its archived articles.

Feed removal/disabling and article purging are separate operations.

Provide an explicit purge workflow when deletion is really requested.

Avoid adding deleted_at to every table without a concrete reason.

