# 42. Database migrations

Use Alembic.

Do not automatically let every application container race to run migrations on startup.

Provide an explicit documented migration command/process.

# 43. PostgreSQL integrity

Use database constraints in addition to application validation.

Use:

* foreign keys
* appropriate unique constraints
* check constraints where meaningful

Do not assume application code alone will preserve integrity.

# 44. Bulk processing

Use bulk operations where beneficial.

Examples:

* entity associations
* keyword associations
* Elasticsearch indexing batches
* ingestion upserts

Avoid one SQL transaction/query per entity or keyword when processing large batches.

# 45. Backups

Include documented Docker-friendly PostgreSQL backup and restore scripts/workflows.

Also document what must be backed up for:

* PostgreSQL
* raw HTML/object storage
* configuration

Elasticsearch does not need to be part of the authoritative backup because it is rebuildable.

